@* A whole turn, three levels deep: the turn, a summary row, and the steps. Text the agent writes
   between steps sits between two BzTrace lists; the reply itself is a Message. *@
<div class="flex w-full max-w-md flex-col gap-5">
    <BzMessage Align="MessageAlign.End">
        <BzMessageContent>
            <BzBubble>
                <BzBubbleContent>Why does checkout charge twice when the payment times out?</BzBubbleContent>
            </BzBubble>
        </BzMessageContent>
    </BzMessage>

    <BzTrace>
        <BzTraceCollapsible DefaultOpen>
            <BzTraceCollapsibleTrigger>
                <BzTraceLine>
                    <BzTraceTitle>Worked for 38s</BzTraceTitle>
                </BzTraceLine>
            </BzTraceCollapsibleTrigger>
            <BzTraceCollapsibleContent KeepRendered Class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <BzTrace>
                    <BzTraceLine>
                        <BzTraceIcon>
                            <BzIcon Icon="@Tabler.Outline.Search" />
                        </BzTraceIcon>
                        <BzTraceTitle>Searched for ChargeAsync</BzTraceTitle>
                        <BzTraceDescription>2 results</BzTraceDescription>
                    </BzTraceLine>
                    <BzTraceLine>
                        <BzTraceIcon>
                            <BzIcon Icon="@Tabler.Outline.FileText" />
                        </BzTraceIcon>
                        <BzTraceTitle>Read PaymentGateway.cs</BzTraceTitle>
                    </BzTraceLine>
                </BzTrace>
                <p class="text-sm">The retry policy wraps the whole charge, so a timeout after the bank accepted it charges again. The request needs an idempotency key.</p>
                <BzTrace>
                    <BzTraceLine>
                        <BzTraceIcon>
                            <BzIcon Icon="@Tabler.Outline.Edit" />
                        </BzTraceIcon>
                        <BzTraceTitle>Edited PaymentGateway.cs</BzTraceTitle>
                        <BzTraceDescription>+6 -2</BzTraceDescription>
                    </BzTraceLine>
                    <BzTraceLine>
                        <BzTraceIcon>
                            <BzIcon Icon="@Tabler.Outline.Terminal2" />
                        </BzTraceIcon>
                        <BzTraceTitle>Ran dotnet test</BzTraceTitle>
                        <BzTraceDescription>14 passed</BzTraceDescription>
                    </BzTraceLine>
                </BzTrace>
            </BzTraceCollapsibleContent>
        </BzTraceCollapsible>
    </BzTrace>

    <BzMessage>
        <BzMessageContent>
            <BzBubble Variant="BubbleVariant.Ghost">
                <BzBubbleContent>
                    The retry repeated the whole charge. Each payment now sends an idempotency key,
                    so the bank ignores the second attempt, and the tests pass.
                </BzBubbleContent>
            </BzBubble>
        </BzMessageContent>
    </BzMessage>
</div>
